# An allowlist (WU-20 plan D2): everything is excluded, then only what the api-nextjs image build
# needs is added back. A new file anywhere, such as an .env.local or a key file, stays out of the
# build context unless it is listed here on purpose.
*

!package.json
!pnpm-lock.yaml
!pnpm-workspace.yaml
!tsconfig.base.json
# Manifests only, so the frozen install sees the whole workspace.
!apps/web-nextjs/package.json
!tests/contract/package.json
!tests/journeys/package.json
!packages/domain-schema/
!backends/api-nextjs/
!.llm-cassettes/api-nextjs/

# Never, even inside an allowed directory.
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/coverage
**/.env*
